WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,110
Sure enough, he came for me.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,530
You really think I'm a soft lion

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:07,530
I can’t fight if I have multiple moves in my hand.

4
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:08,770
If you can't beat me, leave

5
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:17,430
Getting closer and closer, not the stars, but the abyss

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:20,590
What kind of monster is in that dark room? Team Xia can’t see through it at all.

7
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:24,670
I have a bad feeling I'm about to arrive but I still can't feel it clearly, Mr.

8
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:25,990
We are blessed

9
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:27,590
It's a pity that other team members

10
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:29,470
I can't accumulate such a good will

11
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,740
Brother, it's very dangerous up there

12
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:39,740
Don't move

13
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:43,580
Do I need to rescue you, Captain?

14
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,500
He is a mourner
